    "detailed_description": "<strong>MetaGraph</strong> - Unravel the Enigmas of a Virtual Desktop Realm<br><br>Dive into an exciting puzzle adventure with MetaGraph, a unique desktop game that fires up your imagination and challenges your brain. Play as a digital archaeologist exploring a virtual world resembling your desktop but filled with secrets and puzzles.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a gripping puzzles, unraveling the mysteries of an ancient digital civilization. Each landscape hides a distinct puzzle waiting to be solved with every click. MetaGraph combines puzzles and storytelling with cyberpunk-inspired visuals and an awesome soundtrack.<br><br>In this mind-bending game, face challenges that test your logic, creativity, and problem-solving skills. Manipulate time, defy physics, and bend reality to overcome unconventional obstacles.<br><br>MetaGraph is not just a game; it's a visually stunning experience unlocking digital secrets. With easy controls and various tools, dive into endless puzzle-solving possibilities.<br><br>Get ready to explore the wonders of MetaGraph beyond your desktop. Can you decipher the mysterious universe? Take on the ultimate puzzle challenge and become the master of MetaGraph's virtual desktop realm!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584520/extras/a982fc00c7011a2849fbec8cd1483d4e.poster.avif?t=1707746900\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584520/extras/a982fc00c7011a2849fbec8cd1483d4e.webm?t=1707746900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584520/extras/a982fc00c7011a2849fbec8cd1483d4e.mp4?t=1707746900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
